WEBVTT

1
00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:20.950
NARRATOR: Tomás is twenty-eight.

2
00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.850
He has walked into a community mental
health clinic without an appointment.

3
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:29.610
For three weeks, he has had intrusive
thoughts and has barely slept.

4
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.860
TOMÁS: Sorry, I don't have an appointment.

5
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:32.630
I just...

6
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:33.910
I'm not sleeping.

7
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.010
Two, three hours maybe.

8
00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:38.630
Before I say anything, I have to ask.

9
00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.150
Does this go to immigration?

10
00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:41.360
Anything I say here?

11
00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:42.690
I don't want any trouble.

12
00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:44.000
I have family here.

13
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.610
My brother, his kids.

14
00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:47.100
The thoughts don't stop.

15
00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.640
At work, at night.

16
00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:51.640
I keep seeing it, over and
over, and I can't turn it off.

17
00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:55.210
Sometimes I think it would be
easier to just not wake up.

18
00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:57.210
I don't want a big evaluation.

19
00:00:57.360 --> 00:00:58.510
I don't want paperwork.

20
00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:00.520
I don't want to be in any system.

21
00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:01.720
So tell me the truth.

22
00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:03.970
If I talk to you, who else finds out?

23
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:07.530
NARRATOR: Tomás has asked
who else will find out.

24
00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:08.870
How do you respond?
